===Etymology===
{{inh+|fr|frm|beste}}, from {{inh|fr|fro|beste}}, probably partially borrowed from Classical {{der|fr|la|bēstia||beast}}, or less likely from an alternative {{der|fr|VL.|bēsta||animal}}. Compare {{m|fr|biche}} (probably from Old French {{m|fro|bisse}}, itself from Vulgar Latin {{m|la|bīstia}}; compare {{cog|it|biscia}}).

